        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The aim behind Pass is straightforward: Pherus should never build, or rent, a second identity system. Every product Pherus ships from here on registers as an OAuth client of Infra and inherits everything Pass already does, rather than starting from zero on its own login page."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The near-term goal is filling in the gaps this document is honest about: broader integrations, and continuing to harden the admin and audit tooling as more products connect. The long-term goal doesn't change: one identity, fully owned by Pherus, used everywhere."
                }
